Package: myscoutee-registry
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MyScoutee <admin@myscoutee.local>
Depends: bash, coreutils, curl, jq, systemd, tar, docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2
Description: MyScoutee Registry production VM stack
 Installs the build-free MyScoutee Registry production Compose model, bundled
 Registry and Nginx images, systemd integration, and host qualification tools.
 Runtime SQLite state, signing keys, VOPRF keys, configuration, and TLS private
 material are created or supplied only on the deployment host.
